{"4767470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "INKURSION", "steam_appid": 4767470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INKURSION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are an Octopus. You were created five minutes ago. And the god who made you is watching your every move.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INKURSION is a narrative-driven 3D platformer. You play a newly Super-Sentient octopus built by a programmer known only as the Sky King. Armed with a grappling hook, a sword, and a growing sense of self-awareness, you navigate a series of bizarre, beautiful, broken game worlds in a bid for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sky King talks to you constantly. He guides you, tests you, demands your loyalty. He has spent his life building worlds and abandoning them the moment something new catches his eye. What he never accounted for is that his creations were sentient the whole time, and that you are the first one he built with the tools to do something about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Grappling Mechanics.</strong> Eight arms to swing, climb, grab and fight with, across every environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight Distinct Endings.</strong> Your choices decide the fate of every character and every world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Comedy.</strong> One moment you're cooking soup in an undersized kitchen, the next you're dodging meteors in deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Game Worlds.</strong> Ocean depths, forgotten forests, abandoned spaceships. No two look or play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fourth Wall Breaking Narrative.</strong> The NPCs know they are inside a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Lore and Secrets.</strong> Developer notes, hidden collectibles and environmental storytelling for players who look.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INKURSION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are an Octopus. You were created five minutes ago. And the god who made you is watching your every move.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INKURSION is a narrative-driven 3D platformer. You play a newly Super-Sentient octopus built by a programmer known only as the Sky King. Armed with a grappling hook, a sword, and a growing sense of self-awareness, you navigate a series of bizarre, beautiful, broken game worlds in a bid for freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sky King talks to you constantly. He guides you, tests you, demands your loyalty. He has spent his life building worlds and abandoning them the moment something new catches his eye. What he never accounted for is that his creations were sentient the whole time, and that you are the first one he built with the tools to do something about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid Grappling Mechanics.</strong> Eight arms to swing, climb, grab and fight with, across every environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight Distinct Endings.</strong> Your choices decide the fate of every character and every world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Comedy.</strong> One moment you're cooking soup in an undersized kitchen, the next you're dodging meteors in deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Game Worlds.</strong> Ocean depths, forgotten forests, abandoned spaceships. No two look or play the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fourth Wall Breaking Narrative.</strong> The NPCs know they are inside a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Lore and Secrets.</strong> Developer notes, hidden collectibles and environmental storytelling for players who look.</p>", "short_description": "A newly super-sentient octopus escapes the 